translate chinese strings:

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:19
    old "[mc.Name]! You ready for Tuesday?"
    new "[mc.Name]！你为周二的事做好准备了吗？"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:33
    old "Yo, [simon.NickName]! You really wanna go to a strip club on a Tuesday...?"
    new "哟，[simon.NickName]！你真的想在周二去脱衣舞俱乐部……？"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:36
    old "Uhm... I don't want too many people around... Plus, my parents aren't home next week."
    new "嗯……我不希望有太多人……而且，我父母下周不在家。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:39
    old "Yet another business trip?"
    new "又是出差？"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:42
    old "Yeah. I'd rather they didn't know, you feel me?"
    new "是的。我不想让他们知道，你懂我的意思吧？"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:45
    old "Say no more, buddy. Anyway, I'm kinda pumped about all this!"
    new "兄弟，无需多言。总之，我对这一切有点兴奋！"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:48
    old "Ha, that's the spirit! It's gonna be epic!"
    new "哈，就是这种精神！这次绝对会是史诗般的体验！"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:52
    old "... In a nerdy, introvert, sort of way, right? 😂"
    new "……以一种书呆子、内向的方式，对吧？😂"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:55
    old "Exactly! I call for all the nerds to unite at the strip club!"
    new "完全正确！我呼吁所有书呆子在脱衣舞俱乐部团结起来！"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:58
    old "You might wanna hold your horses on that. We don't wanna get kicked out the moment we get there."
    new "你可能得稍微克制一下。我们不想一进去就被赶出来。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:62
    old "Haha, no! Let's go for acceptable levels of epicness."
    new "哈哈，不！让我们追求可接受的史诗水平。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:65
    old "Speaking of horses, I have a dungeon to clear in World of Walls. See ya tomorrow!"
    new "说到马，我在《World of Walls》有一个地牢要清理。明天见！"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:68
    old "I mean... You're coming to school tomorrow, right?"
    new "……你明天会来学校的，对吧？"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:71
    old "Yes, yes, I am. Enjoy your dungeon!"
    new "是的，是的，我会。清理你的地牢吧！"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:112
    old "No, I'll pass."
    new "不，我就不去了。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:117
    old "Do I want to play Between Kingdoms with her?"
    new "我想和她一起玩《Between Kingdoms》吗？"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:376
    old "{font=fonts/medieval.ttf}{size=120}Between Kingdoms{/size}\n\nLoading...{/font}"
    new "{font=fonts/medieval.ttf}{size=120}王国之间{/size}\n\n加载中……{/font}"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:391
    old "{font=fonts/medieval.ttf}{size=80}You won!{/size}{/font}"
    new "{font=fonts/medieval.ttf}{size=80}你赢了！{/size}{/font}"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_19-Sunday.rpy:400
    old "{font=fonts/medieval.ttf}{size=80}You lost...{/size}{/font}"
